<title>USA: Cooper stake cut by Cooper Life.</title>
<headline>Cooper stake cut by Cooper Life.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooper Life Sciences Inc said Friday it cut its stake in Cooper Cos to 1,447,533 common shares, or 12.39 percent, from 13.42 percent previously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Cooper Life said it sold 120,000 common shares between February 20 and February 25 at prices ranging from $21.625 to $22.50 per share.</p>
